- Separate multiple IP addresses or CIDR blocks with commas (,). No spaces are allowed before or after the commas.

- A maximum of 1,000 IP addresses or CIDR blocks can be added to a single instance. If you have a large number of IP addresses, merge them into CIDR blocks, such as 10.23.XXX.XXX/24.
</details>', example='10.23.XXX.XXX', position='Query'),
